<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 219 FOR SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 219 FOR SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 219 for</p>
<p>seven wickets in their 50 overs against South Africa in a</p>
<p>one-day triangular series on Saturday.</p>
</text>
